  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: heap buffer overflow in ngx_http_map_uri_to_path() when\n     $request_filename is evaluated after a rewrite inside an \"alias\" location\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-15176.patch: reject the URI to path mapping for\n       an \"alias\" location while r->uri_changed is set, and clear\n       r->valid_location in ngx_http_script_break_code() when the URI was\n       changed, so a rewritten URI shorter than the location prefix is no\n       longer mapped to a path\n     - CVE-2026-15176",
